{
  "id": "607690735b525cd1",
  "name": "Product photo to UGC video ad with Seedance 2.5 via Revana",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "8cc3dd1c-ed9f-54d1-a5d7-14a915a4e346",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -220,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Product photo to UGC video ad (Seedance 2.5 via Revana)\n\nGive it a public link to your product photo and the line the person says. Seedance 2.5 uses the photo as a reference and renders a 9:16 selfie-style ad with speech.\n\n1. Create a key at https://revana.si/dashboard.\n2. Add a **Header Auth** credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer sr_live_...`. Select it on the three Revana HTTP nodes.\n3. Put your product photo link and script in **Settings** and run.\n\nPriced from the live list first; stops if over `max_cost_usd`. Failed generations are free. Prices: https://revana.si/pricing",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 380
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "28cadc8f-5948-5516-ad32-17d26f3ad795",
      "name": "Start",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "868f2e80-4df5-536e-aa69-1c50c58bd783",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        220,
        100
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "afaa42a3-801d-5a8f-a9a9-ee9a5d804f6d",
              "name": "model",
              "value": "seedance-2.5",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "8d79e90b-04c5-53f5-bb77-105c4d34d792",
              "name": "product_image_url",
              "value": "https://example.com/your-product.jpg",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "fae0a6cf-a262-5bcb-b7cb-d006953db474",
              "name": "person",
              "value": "a woman in her late 20s in a bright kitchen",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "72e284bf-68de-54cd-afdf-b98238ab3b97",
              "name": "line",
              "value": "I stopped buying plastic bottles. This one keeps ice for a whole day.",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d2236128-4710-5fba-ac22-3b7b0fee6fd6",
              "name": "resolution",
              "value": "720p",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "0400e5ab-e7fd-59c7-a0e0-4283dcaf2c22",
              "name": "duration",
              "value": 8,
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "d6fe24d1-065e-57c2-8579-230b77f466b7",
              "name": "aspect_ratio",
              "value": "9:16",
              "type": "string"
            },
